      "quoted_tweet_id": "1999269750560465109",
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "H.J.Res. 104, sponsored by Sen. @SteveDaines, Sen. @TimSheehyMT, @RepRyanZinke, and @RepTroyDowning, overturns Biden-ara restrictions that locked up millions of acres of lands throughout Montana’s Powder River Basin — closing the door on jobs, energy production, revenue, critical minerals and driving up energy costs.\n\n— Overturns restrictions that prohibited future coal leasing throughout the entire Powder River Basin in Montana, or roughly 30% of the entire nation’s coal reserves.\n— Unlocks more than 2.75 million acres of land and 11.7 million acres of mineral estate in Montana.\n— Keeps energy prices affordable and reliable by ensuring access to 37.8 billion short tons of coal, enough supply to meet U.S. coal demand for the next 73 years.\n— Protects approximately $46 million in annual state revenue, which is used to fund public K-12 education in Montana.\n— Generates $15 million in new federal energy revenue.\n— Provides operational certainty for mining operations in Southeastern Montana.",
      "text_resolved": "H.J.Res. 104, sponsored by Sen. @SteveDaines, Sen. @TimSheehyMT, @RepRyanZinke, and @RepTroyDowning, overturns Biden-ara restrictions that locked up millions of acres of lands throughout Montana’s Powder River Basin — closing the door on jobs, energy production, revenue, critical minerals and driving up energy costs.\n\n— Overturns restrictions that prohibited future coal leasing throughout the entire Powder River Basin in Montana, or roughly 30% of the entire nation’s coal reserves.\n— Unlocks more than 2.75 million acres of land and 11.7 million acres of mineral estate in Montana.\n— Keeps energy prices affordable and reliable by ensuring access to 37.8 billion short tons of coal, enough supply to meet U.S. coal demand for the next 73 years.\n— Protects approximately $46 million in annual state revenue, which is used to fund public K-12 education in Montana.\n— Generates $15 million in new federal energy revenue.\n— Provides operational certainty for mining operations in Southeastern Montana.",
